<title>USA: Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Sept same-sales rise.</title>
<headline>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Sept same-sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, N.J. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc said Thursday its same-store sales for September increased by about 9.3 percent.</p>
<p>Net sales for the four weeks, which ended September 22, were about $61.9 million, compared with $46 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>Bed Bath &amp; Beyond expects to have 107 stores in 25 states by the end of its third quarter.</p>
</text>
